  "ingredients": [
    "2 large egg",
    "1 1/2 tablespoon allulose",
    "2 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1/2 teaspoon unflavored gelatin"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Gather and prep all of your ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/easy-dairy-free-vanilla-ice-cream/#wprm-recipe-57996-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Easy-Vanilla-Ice-Cream-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Separate the egg yolks from the egg whites, placing into bowls large enough to use a mixer in.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/easy-dairy-free-vanilla-ice-cream/#wprm-recipe-57996-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Easy-Vanilla-Ice-Cream-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the allulose, vanilla, and gelatin to the egg yolks and whisk together using a hand-held mixer until pale and fluffy.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/easy-dairy-free-vanilla-ice-cream/#wprm-recipe-57996-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Easy-Vanilla-Ice-Cream-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk the egg whites until medium peaks form. Pour in the egg yolks and fold to incorporate.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/easy-dairy-free-vanilla-ice-cream/#wprm-recipe-57996-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Easy-Vanilla-Ice-Cream-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour into a freezer-safe container and freeze for 4-6 hours until the consistency you desire is reached. Alternatively, you can use an ice cream machine.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/easy-dairy-free-vanilla-ice-cream/#wprm-recipe-57996-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Easy-Vanilla-Ice-Cream-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once ready to eat, scoop and serve. It should be ready to go out of the freezer as it melts relatively quickly. Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/easy-dairy-free-vanilla-ice-cream/#wprm-recipe-57996-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
